1\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nIt's been a long time since Nick visited the park where he spent his childhood days. So, he planned a visit and took his young son, Phil. On the way, they crossed the old tree where Nick used to play with his friends. He noticed that his son was looking at the engraved initials on the tree with his eyes wide open.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Nick ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Sentimental\nB) Anticipation\nC) Indifferent\nD) Disapproval\nE) Hopeful\nF) Nervousness\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Nick feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) His childhood memories are attached to the park and that tree\nB) His son, Phil ran away without telling him\nC) He hasn't visited the park for a long time\nD) He hates the park now but used to love it in his childhood","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.025957358328060655,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6349aa9dc5a833d9764","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483764450,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e17f8d32a5dc4f3e8bf2c437e33a5236"}